          <span class="w-full md:w-auto shrink-0 px-6 py-3 md:py-4 bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border border-indigo-200 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest rounded-xl text-center whitespace-nowrap">Unlocked</span>
